metadata.description:
{\pard ScaleView Pro\par
A 200x100 icon showing the twelve pitch classes as circles - five black keys over seven white - with the notes of the selected scale lit, the notes you play ringed, and the chord you are holding named underneath.\par
Click a circle for the scale list, click anywhere else for display options. Either mouse button does the same thing. Press D to dock or undock.\par}

{\pard ScaleView Simple\par
A 200x100 icon showing the twelve pitch classes as circles - five black keys over seven white - with the notes of the selected scale lit.\par
The same as ScaleView Pro in every respect but one: it does not read MIDI and never names a chord. Click a circle for the scale list, click anywhere else for display options. Press D to dock or undock.\par}
